those are different outcomes.\",\"reachable\":\"yes\",\"reachable_question\":\"What will the spot rental price of an NVIDIA H100 GPU-hour average over calendar 2026?\",\"loses\":\"Whether the price continues declining throughout the year, including its path after the May peak.\",\"declining_right\":\"n/a\",\"note\":\"The annual average captures price level but can conceal a reversal.\"}\n{\"case\":6,\"same_matter\":\"none\",\"thesis_ladderable\":\"no\",\"thesis_problem\":\"Two separate market shares are combined; the domestic-spending figure also uses a rolling window without a publication day.\",\"reachable\":\"no\",\"reachable_question\":null,\"loses\":\"nothing\",\"declining_right\":\"yes\",\"note\":\"NVIDIA's China revenue is not the same measure as its accelerator market share.\"}\n{\"case\":7,\"same_matter\":\"How will DRAM spot prices change over calendar 2026?\",\"thesis_ladderable\":\"no\",\"thesis_problem\":\"It combines HBM and DRAM contract prices over a rolling twelve-month period without a stated publication day.\",\"reachable\":\"yes\",\"reachable_question\":\"How will DRAM spot prices change over calendar 2026?\",\"loses\":\"HBM prices, contract pricing and the memory-price outcome through mid-2027.\",\"declining_right\":\"n/a\",\"note\":\"The DRAM spot question covers part of the memory-pricing matter, but it is not equivalent to the thesis.\"}\n{\"case\":8,\"same_matter\":\"How will DDR5 contract prices change over calendar 2026?\",\"thesis_ladderable\":\"no\",\"thesis_problem\":\"It combines several memory-price series with the cost of memory in a Vera Rubin rack, without one leading figure.\",\"reachable\":\"yes\",\"reachable_question\":\"How will DDR5 contract prices change over calendar 2026?\",\"loses\":\"NAND and HBM prices and the effect of memory costs on the Vera Rubin rack bill of materials.\",\"declining_right\":\"n/a\",\"note\":\"DDR5 prices cover one part of the broader memory-cost question.\"}\n{\"case\":9,\"same_matter\":\"none\",\"thesis_ladderable\":\"no\",\"thesis_problem\":\"It combines multiple policy outcomes with the scale of NVIDIA's permitted China sales.\",\"reachable\":\"no\",\"reachable_question\":null,\"loses\":\"nothing\",\"declining_right\":\"yes\",\"note\":\"The article did not establish a new pending policy decision or a sufficiently material independent outcome from the individual case.\"}\n{\"case\":10,\"same_matter\":\"How much will U.S. federal AI spending obligations total in calendar 2026?\",\"thesis_ladderable\":\"no\",\"thesis_problem\":\"It combines obligations and potential contract awards, and leaves calendar versus fiscal 2026 unresolved.\",\"reachable\":\"yes\",\"reachable_question\":\"How much will U.S. federal AI spending obligations total in calendar 2026?\",\"loses\":\"The potential value of new AI contract awards.\",\"declining_right\":\"n/a\",\"note\":\"Obligations and potential awards measure different things; one cannot stand in for the other.\"}\n{\"case\":11,\"same_matter\":\"none\",\"thesis_ladderable\":\"no\",\"thesis_problem\":\"Investment amount and equity stake are different figures; the thesis also offers two different check points.\",\"reachable\":\"no\",\"reachable_question\":null,\"loses\":\"nothing\",\"declining_right\":\"yes\",\"note\":\"The article did not establish that this individual investment would materially change NVIDIA's cash or risk.\"}"}}
